          "title": "You'll want to know: स्वादः",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "स्वादः — svādaḥ — \"a flavour\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "एतस्य सूपस्य स्वादः उत्तमः अस्ति। etasya sūpasya svādaḥ uttamaḥ asti. This dal has a fine flavour."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A masculine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "स्वादः (svādaḥ) comes from the root √svad, \"to be sweet, to relish\"; MW gives svāda as taste, flavour, savour (MW)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
